    <string name="menu_help">Help</string>
    <string name="help_title">How to use TextGrabber</string>
        
    
    
    <string name="help_text">CAPTURE TEXT: 1) Tap Enable floating button and grant permission. 2) Open any app, tap the button. 3) OCR runs automatically, tap Open text. | VOICE READING: 1) Tap Enable Accessibility Service. 2) Long-press floating button to read whole screen. | FROM SPECIFIC POINT: - Selected text: long-press text, then floating button. - From button position: drag button to start point, long-press. | SPEED: slider 30-130 percent. | VOICE: only Sevinch. More voices - install RHVoice. | SCREEN OFF: reading continues.</string>
